barbed devil. Air had only three djinni. Fire had one minotaur. Plane of 
Water had the only ; class monsters and few other from "Monsters appear 
from nowhere!". Water was tedious, since I didn't want to move to avoid 
accidentally stepping on the portal.

You arrive in the Astral Plane!

