Then, only and Olog-hai, Riders, high priest of Anhur and me. To get rid 
of the Riders, I had to fill the level with acid blobs. Since the two pets 
would kill them and render my plan useless, I had to kill also the two 
remaining As in the world.

http://www.iki.fi/pnuu/seko/blobbed_astral_and_no_riders.png

