was to charm and displace the blobs. Killing all the pet blobs and the 
high priest (lost my protection there) didn't do good to my alignment, but 
I had to finish my task!

I didn't want to ascend with my god angry, so I created some more blobs 
and sacrificed the corpses (and some others appearing from nowhere). After 
some turns I got the four-leaf clover message, prayed and got one point of 
protection :-) I emptied my potions to maximise stats, felt lonely and 
